              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and delicious! I cut down on the serving size and since I like my cocktail sauce a little more on the hot side and a little less sweet I decreased the amount of sugar to suit my tastes. I would suggest starting off with a small amount and adding in until you find the taste you like."
          },
          {
