              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Craig deFreese"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe to build on. This is my go to formula. Never buy store bought anymore. I tweak a little with apple cider vinegar instead of lemon juice, a little extra horseradish, ground pepper, and cayenne. Like others, I go light on sugar. When I make shrimp, I pull up this recipe. Haven't found anything better. Congratulations on a great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2021-04-25T22:19:47.730Z"
          },
